  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Loose Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Pores</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A talc-free ultra-translucent 12-hr setting + baking powder that blurs, brightens + sweeps away shine, not glow. Now in new complexion shades.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Loose Powder</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Bamboo Stem Extract: Absorbs excess sebum so skin feels soft and fresh.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This featherweight powder melts into skin with an airbrushed finish—never cakey, powdery, or drying. It sweeps away the look of pores and fine lines for a smoother, he</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>To Bake:</p><p>-Use a powder puff to apply a generous layer of powder where you experience the most creasing or oil breakthrough.</p><p>-Let sit for a few minutes and then brush off the excess.</p><p><br></p><p>To Set:</p><p>-Use a fluffy powder brush to dust a light layer of product all over face—focusing on areas where you experience the most oil breakthrough.</p><p>-Use the Kosas Face Detailer Brush (sold separately) for smaller areas like under eyes.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Mica, Silica, Isodecyl Neopentanoate, Bambusa Arundinacea Stem Extract, Boron Nitride, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, C15-19 Alkane, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Citric Acid, Glyceryl Undecylenate, Glyceryl Caprylate, Pentylene Glycol, Sodium Dehydroacetate [+/-: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)]</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Loose Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Pores</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A talc-free ultra-translucent 12-hr setting + baking powder that blurs, brightens + sweeps away shine, not glow. Now in new complexion shades.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Loose Powder</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Bamboo Stem Extract: Absorbs excess sebum so skin feels soft and fresh.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This featherweight powder melts into skin with an airbrushed finish—never cakey, powdery, or drying. It sweeps away the look of pores and fine lines for a smoother, he</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>To Bake:</p><p>-Use a powder puff to apply a generous layer of powder where you experience the most creasing or oil breakthrough.</p><p>-Let sit for a few minutes and then brush off the excess.</p><p><br></p><p>To Set:</p><p>-Use a fluffy powder brush to dust a light layer of product all over face—focusing on areas where you experience the most oil breakthrough.</p><p>-Use the Kosas Face Detailer Brush (sold separately) for smaller areas like under eyes.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Mica, Silica, Isodecyl Neopentanoate, Bambusa Arundinacea Stem Extract, Boron Nitride, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, C15-19 Alkane, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Citric Acid, Glyceryl Undecylenate, Glyceryl Caprylate, Pentylene Glycol, Sodium Dehydroacetate [+/-: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)]</p></div></details>",
